    "title": "Sendwave\u2014Send Money",
    "description": "Join the 500,000 active users who have trusted Sendwave to transfer over $10 billion back home to their loved ones. Download the app and start sending money today.   \r\n\r\nSECURE AND TRUSTED\r\n* We're approved by the FCA (UK) and licensed by regulators around the world.\r\n* We've received over 6,000 5-star reviews and have a 4.6-star rating on Trustpilot.\r\n* Count on secure transactions thanks to industry standard 128-bit encryption.\r\n\r\nAS EASY AND AFFORDABLE AS SENDING A TEXT\r\n* Clear, transparent exchange rates and no guessing about fees. * Real-time updates on the status of your transfers. \r\n* Need help? We have 24/7 support available if you need it.\r\n\r\nWE SUPPORT A WIDE RANGE OF COUNTRIES AND CURRENCIES INCLUDING: \r\n\r\nAFRICA\r\n* Cameroon\r\n* Cote D'Ivoire\r\n* Ghana\r\n* Kenya\r\n* Liberia\r\n* Nigeria: USD bank accounts and USD cash pickup\r\n* Senegal\r\n* Tanzania\r\n* Uganda\r\n\r\nOur African partners include M-Pesa, MTN, Airtel, and more.  \r\n\r\nASIA\r\n* Bangladesh\r\n* Philippines\r\n* Sri Lanka\r\n* Coming soon: Vietnam, Thailand \r\n\r\nOur Asian partners include: Metrobank, GCash, bKash, and more. \r\n\r\nAMERICAS\r\n* Haiti\r\n* Dominican Republic\r\n\r\nMIDDLE EAST\r\n* Lebanon\r\n\r\nhelp@sendwave.com\r\n51 Eastcheap, London, EC3M 1DT, UK",
